{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An Origami → SwiftUI translator: a deterministic parser reads Facebook’s "},{"code":".origami","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"patch graph into a semantic IR, and a codegen writes that IR out as SwiftUI. Swami"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is also the patch-matched helper library that fills gaps between Origami patches"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and native SwiftUI — one helper per Origami patch, named after the patch, sized by"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s patch surface. Every pattern that lands is a deliverable, verified against"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s own render, and shipped as a DocC-embedded example."}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[[]]},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"kind":"symbol","identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Framework","modules":[{"name":"Swami"}],"role":"collection","title":"Swami","externalID":"Swami","symbolKind":"module"},"topicSections":[{"title":"Reference","anchor":"Reference","identifiers":["doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/OrigamiMappings","doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Beats"]},{"title":"Helpers","anchor":"Helpers","identifiers":["doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction","doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Drag"]},{"title":"Examples","anchor":"Examples","identifiers":["doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/TouchOrigamiExampleView","doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_DragView"]},{"title":"Articles","generated":true,"anchor":"Articles","identifiers":["doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_Drag"]},{"title":"Extended Modules","generated":true,"anchor":"Extended-Modules","identifiers":["doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/SwiftUICore"]}],"